  <diagram name="Page-1" id="tGfvavUWGa7DgKvFAtfg">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2512" dy="53" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram: Regenerate Past Result (POST /analyses/{analysis_id}/regenerate)\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 18\nskinparam sequence {\n  ParticipantBackgroundColor #DCDCF0\n  ParticipantBorderColor #555555\n  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n  ActorBorderColor #555555\n  LifeLineBorderColor #888888\n  ArrowColor #333333\n  GroupBorderColor #333333\n}\nskinparam database {\n  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n  BorderColor #333333\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Research User\&quot; as User\nparticipant \&quot;Web Dashboard\\n(M7)\&quot; as UI\nparticipant \&quot;Model Service\\nREST API (M3)\&quot; as API\ndatabase \&quot;Analysis Log\&quot; as AN\ndatabase \&quot;Model Registry\\nand Run Log\&quot; as REG\ndatabase \&quot;Connectomes\&quot; as CON\n\nUser -&gt; UI : select past analysis in History,\\nclick Regenerate\nactivate User\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; API : POST /analyses/{analysis_id}/regenerate\nactivate API\n\nAPI -&gt; AN : get past analysis (analysis_id)\nactivate AN\nAN --&gt; API : the stored record\ndeactivate AN\n\nbreak analysis_id not in the Analysis Log\n  API --&gt; UI : 404, unknown analysis\n  UI --&gt; User : show message, return to History\nend\n\nAPI -&gt; REG : get the original run (run_id of the past analysis,\\nnot the current model)\nactivate REG\nREG --&gt; API : graph settings, checkpoint path and hash,\\ncalibration of that run if it exists\ndeactivate REG\n\nbreak run not in the Run Log, no checkpoint saved,\\nor checkpoint file not on this machine\n  API --&gt; UI : 503, original model not available\n  UI --&gt; User : show \&quot;Cannot reproduce\&quot;, return to History\nend\n\nAPI -&gt; API : load original checkpoint,\\ncheck its SHA-256 against the run log\n\nbreak checkpoint does not match its recorded hash\n  API --&gt; UI : 503, original model cannot be used\n  UI --&gt; User : show \&quot;Cannot reproduce\&quot;, return to History\nend\n\nAPI -&gt; CON : load stored connectome (participant_id, atlas)\nactivate CON\nCON --&gt; API : connectome, or not found\ndeactivate CON\n\nbreak no connectome for this participant and atlas\n  API --&gt; UI : 503, participant data not available\n  UI --&gt; User : show reason, return to History\nend\n\nAPI -&gt; API : build graph with the original run&#39;s settings\nAPI -&gt; API : predict, apply that run&#39;s calibration if it exists\n\nAPI -&gt; AN : save new record\\n(reproduces_analysis_id = original analysis_id)\nactivate AN\nAN --&gt; API : the new stored record\ndeactivate AN\n\nbreak new record could not be saved\n  API --&gt; UI : 503, analysis could not be recorded\n  UI --&gt; User : show reason, return to History\nend\n\nAPI -&gt; API : compare original and new record: prediction, calibrated,\\nconfidence to 4 decimals -&gt; identical, differences\n\nAPI --&gt; UI : 201: analysis (new record), original, identical, differences\ndeactivate API\n\nalt identical is true\n  UI --&gt; User : show \&quot;Result reproduced\&quot; with both records\nelse identical is false\n  UI --&gt; User : show mismatch warning, the differing\\nfields and both records\nend\ndeactivate UI\ndeactivate User\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="LEdyuIJSV7G37sX_gvSx-2">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
